Description: Link EGL, X11 and Wayland explicitly in slic3r-platform-wx
 The wx libraries are static and the wx CONFIG package does not propagate
 these dependencies, so without them the final link fails with
 "DSO missing from command line". Each is gated on the matching
 gtk+-{x11,wayland}-3.0 pkg-config file.
